WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
A physical Unitree G1 recovers after an external disturbance.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.233
BeJEPA: a goal-conditioned humanoid behavior world model.

00:12.233 --> 00:22.000
The goal combines whole-body posture, world position, and heading.

00:22.000 --> 00:38.000
Dynamic predicts the next state embedding. Successor summarizes future behavior.

00:38.000 --> 00:49.233
Motion-tracking and goal-inference results compare BeJEPA with baselines.

00:49.233 --> 00:58.233
Goal and real-robot views show recovery from the ground.

00:58.233 --> 01:22.667
The robot changes posture, position, and heading while following world-anchored goals.

01:22.667 --> 01:27.667
A montage compares goal states and behavior on the physical robot.
